{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02962","headline":"奉和圣制赐诸州刺史以题座右 · 张九龄","name":"奉和圣制赐诸州刺史以题座右","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣人合天德，洪覆在元元。\n每劳苍生念，不以黄屋尊。\n兴化俟羣辟，择贤守列藩。\n得人此爲盛，咨岳今复存。\n降鉴引君道，殷勤啓政门。\n容光无不照，有象必爲言。\n成宪知所奉，致理归其根。\n肃肃禀玄猷，煌煌戒朱轩。\n岂徒任遇重，兼尔宴锡繁。\n载闻励臣节，持答明主恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02962.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02962","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}